.TH TENSOR-GPU-SYSTEMD-ADAPTER 1 "2026-11-24" "Tensor GPU" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tensor-gpu-systemd-adapter \- read-only systemd/NVIDIA lease backend preflight
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python3 shared/scripts/tensor-gpu-systemd-adapter.py
.RI [ --required-free-mib " N" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reports GPU memory, CUDA processes, model residency, and scoped systemd
service state using the existing tensor-gpu-probe.py implementation.
The CLI does not perform acquire, release, process termination, service
stop/start, VRAM purging, or queued inference execution.
.PP
The internal TensorDesktopBackend supports a restricted DesktopBackend
interface and is tested with injected fake systemd/NVIDIA observations.
It must not be wired into unattended production until crash recovery,
request-level GPU ownership, and independent wallpaper restart inhibition
are implemented and validated.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on a completed read-only report, 1 when evidence is not verifiable.
A denied admission candidate is expected and is not an error.
.SH FILES
iragonforce/ops/shared/scripts/tensor-gpu-systemd-adapter.py
.br
iragonforce/ops/shared/scripts/tensor-gpu-probe.py
.SH SEE ALSO
tensor-gpu-lease(1), tensor-gpu-probe(1), tensor-gpu-queue(1)
